      "no_speech_prob": 0.004793028347194195
    },
    {
      "start": 67.94,
      "end": 69.78,
      "text": "那这个单第一是成不了",
      "avg_logprob": -0.21525185459230575,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004793028347194195
    },
    {
      "start": 69.78,
      "end": 72.16,
      "text": "如果你没有商业能力只知道技术",
      "avg_logprob": -0.21525185459230575,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004793028347194195
    },
    {
      "start": 72.16,
      "end": 74.42,
      "text": "那你不知道企业行业的no-how的时候",
      "avg_logprob": -0.21525185459230575,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004793028347194195
    },
    {
      "start": 74.42,
      "end": 77.7,
      "text": "做地做这个项目的时候会非常的极受",
      "avg_logprob": -0.21525185459230575,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004793028347194195
    },
    {
      "start": 77.7,
      "end": 80.1,
      "text": "而且效果肯定是不理想的",
      "avg_logprob": -0.21525185459230575,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004793028347194195
    },
    {
      "start": 80.1,
      "end": 82.3,
      "text": "那就是为什么很多的战略资讯",
